    q: 'What is parging and does my foundation need it?',
    a: 'Parging is a thin cement-based coat applied to the exposed part of a foundation wall. It protects the surface from moisture and weather and gives a clean, finished look. If your foundation coating is cracked or flaking, our parging service can restore it.',
